  "purpose": "Prevent orphan results while preserving parallel research and automatic Driver continuation. Every return pins one exact publication generation and execution record. Multiple results remain separate immutable evidence and are never synthesized by timestamp. Any Driver review ID not in the frozen legacy baseline cannot terminalize runtime control until a valid automatic follow-up taskset (or canonical closed-parent exception) exists.",
